BT /F1 10.5 Tf 1 0 0 1 54.00 716.00 Tm (licensee's counter-play: a company taking the long view pushes for fixed-fee and fully paid agreements so that higher) Tj ET
BT /F1 10.5 Tf 1 0 0 1 54.00 700.77 Tm (sales never raise its cost [SkIAUEkenak @ 00:08:26]. The result is a split playbook. Stewart's camp negotiates the size) Tj ET
BT /F1 10.5 Tf 1 0 0 1 54.00 685.55 Tm (of the shelf footprint first and treats percentage points as secondary, while UpCounsel's camp anchors the number on) Tj ET
