BT /F1 10.5 Tf 1 0 0 1 54.00 655.10 Tm (Exclusivity splits the room. Andrew Ayers tells clients who are intent on protecting a product to use the exclusive) Tj ET
BT /F1 10.5 Tf 1 0 0 1 54.00 639.87 Tm (license, because its most important feature is the ability to sue and stop anyone else using the licensed product, yet) Tj ET
BT /F1 10.5 Tf 1 0 0 1 54.00 624.65 Tm (concedes a non-exclusive license could make a lot more money because more people can use it [lVFYoVaNnrs @) Tj ET
BT /F1 10.5 Tf 1 0 0 1 54.00 609.42 Tm (00:03:25]. J.D. Houvener frames exclusivity as putting a lot of eggs in one basket that has to be managed harder,) Tj ET
