BT /F1 10.5 Tf 1 0 0 1 54.00 655.10 Tm ($1,500. A non-provisional runs $15K to $30K, with lawyers billing $380 to $500 an hour and issuance taking 3 to 5) Tj ET
BT /F1 10.5 Tf 1 0 0 1 54.00 639.87 Tm (years. Stewart treats the provisional as a timestamp that buys one year and can be refiled if more data is needed) Tj ET
BT /F1 10.5 Tf 1 0 0 1 54.00 624.65 Tm ([jxdKIK4n-Dk @ 00:48:53]. Columbia's Herschwitz files provisionals on about 67% of inventions and converts) Tj ET
