BT /F1 10.5 Tf 1 0 0 1 54.00 337.65 Tm (litigate does not sell, and suing Samsung or Apple runs $3 to 5 million with plaintiffs winning roughly 1 in 3 or 1 in 4) Tj ET
BT /F1 10.5 Tf 1 0 0 1 54.00 322.42 Tm (times [t98CwzofUz0 @ 00:35:13]. SVBS stacks more cost on top: an IPR at about $250,000, expert witnesses at $356) Tj ET
BT /F1 10.5 Tf 1 0 0 1 54.00 307.20 Tm (to $478 an hour and often several million per case, plus fee-shifting exposure where losing can mean paying more than) Tj ET
