BT /F1 10.5 Tf 1 0 0 1 54.00 276.75 Tm (bill, funders walk and buyers do not bid.) Tj ET
BT /F1 10.5 Tf 1 0 0 1 54.00 261.52 Tm (The second cluster of failures is self-inflicted at the market stage. Carbonneau can 'predict with 100% certainty' that a) Tj ET
BT /F1 10.5 Tf 1 0 0 1 54.00 246.30 Tm (portfolio with no evidence of use will not sell, and Tangible IP declines portfolios that have been shopped so widely) Tj ET
BT /F1 10.5 Tf 1 0 0 1 54.00 231.07 Tm (they are burned [t98CwzofUz0 @ 00:34:27]. Parallel North IP sees the same burn: contacting companies too early) Tj ET
BT /F1 10.5 Tf 1 0 0 1 54.00 215.85 Tm (means no response when you come back on a second approach, so outreach should be limited to the entities that matter) Tj ET
