BT /F1 10.5 Tf 1 0 0 1 54.00 468.00 Tm (Section 4: Firsthand Failure Modes, Traps & Economics Checks) Tj ET
BT /F1 10.5 Tf 1 0 0 1 54.00 445.77 Tm (The first trap is assuming the headline fee is your fee. It's Julisa walks a $5,000 placement through a 50 percent sync) Tj ET
BT /F1 10.5 Tf 1 0 0 1 54.00 430.55 Tm (agency and a 50/50 producer split and lands at $1,250 per writer, warning how fast the money goes, though most) Tj ET
BT /F1 10.5 Tf 1 0 0 1 54.00 415.32 Tm (agencies sit closer to 25 to 35 percent [hoMi3ZhgFlc @ 00:03:15]. Through a typical library the fee can drop to zero,) Tj ET
BT /F1 10.5 Tf 1 0 0 1 54.00 400.10 Tm (and because the library registers the song and keeps the publisher share, the back end shrinks to the writer share, halved) Tj ET
BT /F1 10.5 Tf 1 0 0 1 54.00 384.87 Tm (again if a producer is on the track [hoMi3ZhgFlc @ 00:05:06]. Randy McGravey Music runs the sub-publisher version:) Tj ET
BT /F1 10.5 Tf 1 0 0 1 54.00 369.65 Tm (on a $1,000 placement the sub-publisher takes about $250 off the top and the composer and library split the remainder,) Tj ET
BT /F1 10.5 Tf 1 0 0 1 54.00 354.42 Tm (leaving the composer $375, which McGravey calls not ideal but still worth it because the majors actually collect sync) Tj ET
BT /F1 10.5 Tf 1 0 0 1 54.00 339.20 Tm (fees [iF_Z6ikfzMo @ 00:11:11]. Timing leaks too: xJ-Will says the upfront fee lands three to 12 months after the show) Tj ET
BT /F1 10.5 Tf 1 0 0 1 54.00 323.97 Tm (airs, with cue-sheet royalties arriving later still through the PRO [SEliWc2Tz3k @ 00:04:03]. Model every deal net of) Tj ET
BT /F1 10.5 Tf 1 0 0 1 54.00 308.75 Tm (agency cut, sub-publisher cut, co-writer split and payment lag before counting a single dollar of it as income, because) Tj ET
BT /F1 10.5 Tf 1 0 0 1 54.00 293.52 Tm (the gross number on the placement email is never the number that hits your account.) Tj ET
BT /F1 10.5 Tf 1 0 0 1 54.00 278.30 Tm (The second trap is the advance. macProVideoDotCom models a $10,000 advance on a 50/50 publishing deal with) Tj ET
BT /F1 10.5 Tf 1 0 0 1 54.00 263.07 Tm (songs earning $5,000 a year: the publisher keeps 100 percent of non-performance income while crediting the writer half) Tj ET
BT /F1 10.5 Tf 1 0 0 1 54.00 247.85 Tm (toward recoupment, so the writer sees no new non-performance royalties until year four [tk2j8egQtvo @ 00:02:47].) Tj ET
BT /F1 10.5 Tf 1 0 0 1 54.00 232.62 Tm (IN\(C\) TALK reframes the same mechanics with a $12,000 advance that recoups across three statements before a) Tj ET
BT /F1 10.5 Tf 1 0 0 1 54.00 217.40 Tm ($3,000 check clears, stressing that the artist did not lose the money but received it early, and that revenue earned,) Tj ET
BT /F1 10.5 Tf 1 0 0 1 54.00 202.17 Tm (royalties credited, advances received, recoupment balance and cash paid must stay separate on your books) Tj ET
BT /F1 10.5 Tf 1 0 0 1 54.00 186.95 Tm ([TYLVikvshaE @ 00:03:44]. The attorney guest on Producer Royalty flags the lock-in clause: terms of three years or) Tj ET
BT /F1 10.5 Tf 1 0 0 1 54.00 171.72 Tm (recoupment mean an unrecouped writer is still in the deal after the term ends, so the fix is a negotiated buyout right) Tj ET
BT /F1 10.5 Tf 1 0 0 1 54.00 156.50 Tm (priced at 110 to 125 percent of the unrecouped balance [gN8CTjqp8lA @ 00:14:32]. The same guest calls beat-lease) Tj ET
BT /F1 10.5 Tf 1 0 0 1 54.00 141.27 Tm (stream caps, such as a lease ending at 50,000 streams, very hard to police, so the real leverage is having that clause on) Tj ET
BT /F1 10.5 Tf 1 0 0 1 54.00 126.05 Tm (paper when a record blows up with a label [gN8CTjqp8lA @ 00:29:11].) Tj ET
BT /F1 10.5 Tf 1 0 0 1 54.00 110.82 Tm (The third trap is giving away or polluting the asset itself. Dr. Lauryn B says experts have handed other companies) Tj ET
BT /F1 10.5 Tf 1 0 0 1 54.00 95.60 Tm (billions of dollars in free value by transferring whole onboarding processes outright, when the structure should be) Tj ET
BT /F1 10.5 Tf 1 0 0 1 54.00 80.37 Tm (permission for a term, with ongoing updates and leadership mentoring, because licensing always has a term limit) Tj ET
